"NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription" = "ChronoGraph reads selected calendars for previews and image export. After you explicitly confirm sharing, it writes copies with your chosen visibility to a separate calendar in the selected account. The account provider can sync them to the cloud, with ongoing updates under your confirmed rules. You enable public sharing separately in Apple Calendar.";
